A person who contributes code, text or design to the Software (a "Contribution") does so as a member of Team 610
and, by contributing, assigns to Team 610 all of their copyright in the Contribution, to the extent the law
allows, and otherwise grants Team 610 an exclusive, perpetual, worldwide, irrevocable, royalty-free license to use
it for any purpose. A contributor keeps the right to describe their own role and general skills. Contributors
who are minors confirm that a parent or guardian has agreed to this section where the law requires it.

